Step 1:

If you want to change username and password of the ISO open the `koompi.json` and change from there

```
nano koompi.json

```
Step 2:

Run the command below after you made change to the config file already, to install the OS.

```
sudo pibee config koompi.json

```

Step 3:
Reboot the vm, you might wanna call the API to start the VM one more time.
```
sudo reboot
```